  "name": "Players Club Original Holo Card Campaign 2006",
  "category": "campaign",
  "description": {
    "text": "In spring 2006, 2,000 winners of a postcard lottery, entered with tickets from the Kyogre ex and Groudon ex constructed starter decks, got the Pokémon Card Game Players Club's three cosmos holofoil legendary birds as a set: Moltres ex 009/PLAY, Articuno ex 010/PLAY and Zapdos ex 011/PLAY. The club, launched in January 2003 as the successor of the Pokémon Card Fan Club, had first given them to members who joined in its second season, 2004. The same art came in English as Nintendo Black Star Promos 31 to 33.",
